# sortBlock

- _sortBlock([x₁ x₂ …])_

Answer the sort block of the sorted list _x_.

```
>>> SortedList[1 3 5 7 9]
>>> .sortBlock
>>> .name
'precedes/2'

>>> SortedList([1 3 5 7 9], <)
>>> .sortBlock
>>> .operatorName
'<'
```

* * *

See also: SortedList

